{"id":"8225a5a04158160a","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-variable.md","title":"Variables","display":"df-variable — Variables","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-variable","aliases":["90-df-variable"],"display":"df-variable — Variables","depends_on":["[[90-df-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variable — Variables"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2f6e5380b315983\" href=\"?note=f2f6e5380b315983\" title=\"90-df-language\">90-df-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\\)</span>，共用的变量符号表和叶嵌入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2f6e5380b315983\" href=\"?note=f2f6e5380b315983\" title=\"90-df-language\">90-df-language</a>。上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"88\">\\(88\\)</span> 保留原调用的拼写，现由本书内部文件定义；它不要求读取第 88 本。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda,\\Lambda&#39;\">\\(\\Lambda,\\Lambda&#39;\\)</span> 的实例使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto v_i\">\\(i\\mapsto v_i\\)</span>，尤其在包含签名下不重新编号变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>涉及另一签名时假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda&#39;)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda&#39;)\\)</span>，且变量符号表不更换。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq V,\\qquad v_i^\\Lambda\\coloneqq v_i,\\\\\nv_i^\\Lambda=v_j^\\Lambda&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i=j,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad v_i^\\Lambda&amp;=v_i^{\\Lambda&#39;},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VTerm}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x():x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq V,\\qquad v_i^\\Lambda\\coloneqq v_i,\\\\\nv_i^\\Lambda=v_j^\\Lambda&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i=j,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad v_i^\\Lambda&amp;=v_i^{\\Lambda&#39;},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VTerm}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x():x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 变量在树标签位置取符号，在项位置取其叶嵌入；不会把变量代码误用作变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"f2f6e5380b315983","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"f2f6e5380b315983","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)$，共用的变量符号表和叶嵌入取 [[90-df-language]]。上标 $88$ 保留原调用的拼写，现由本书内部文件定义；它不要求读取第 88 本。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"88","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda,\\Lambda'","display":false},{"tex":"i\\mapsto v_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda')","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda&\\coloneqq V,\\qquad v_i^\\Lambda\\coloneqq v_i,\\\\\nv_i^\\Lambda=v_j^\\Lambda&\\Longleftrightarrow i=j,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad v_i^\\Lambda&=v_i^{\\Lambda'},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VTerm}_\\Lambda&\\coloneqq\\{x():x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1255,"backlinks":[{"id":"695f658f5cc56144","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"上标 $88$ 和下标 $88$ 是原调用接口的保留拼写，现均由第 90 本本地依赖定义，不要求读取外部文件：$\\mathrm{Var}^{88},\\mathrm{Term}^{88},\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88},\\mathrm{Fml}^{88},\\operatorname{var}^{88},\\operatorname{free}^{88},\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}$ 及在可代入域上的 $[t/x]_{88}$ 分别取 [[90-df-variable]]、[[90-df-term]]、[[90-df-atomic-formula]]、[[90-df-base-formula]]、[[90-df-base-free-variable]]、[[90-df-substitution]]；签名条件见 [[90-df-language]]。"},{"id":"242d776aa7405493","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-variable]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["f2f6e5380b315983"]}